{"id":"666121","name":"酸菜肉沫","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/666121/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"酸菜","amount":"250g"},{"name":"肉沫","amount":"半斤"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"红辣椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"富硒酸菜。","img":"images/666121/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"取出备用。","img":"images/666121/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"肉沫备用。","img":"images/666121/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"切好的蒜、红辣椒和葱备用。","img":"images/666121/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅烧热放适量油，倒入肉沫加适量盐和少许老抽调味，煸炒，再倒入红辣椒葱蒜，大火翻炒出香味，继续倒入酸菜，翻炒片刻，加少许鸡精调味即可。","img":"images/666121/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"装盘即食。","img":"images/666121/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"酸辣美味。","img":"images/666121/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}